{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52640","headline":"大唐封东岳朝觐颂附诗 · 苏頲","name":"大唐封东岳朝觐颂附诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子圣兮天孙崇，登以封兮报以功。\n受命再惟皇代，天之赉人所载。\n士马山嶫，戈矛山沓，祯符山杂，灵响山答，天与人合。\n我铺衍兮长粹清，太元册兮太一精，休光光我之庆成，舜四朝而禹万国，莫之我京。\n（见《唐文粹》卷十九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52640.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52640","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}